    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d683">

                <pb facs="0586" n="574" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg574"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">890F.7962/24: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Saudi Arabia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Moose</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jidda</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-08-12T13:00:00+03:06">August 12, 1942—1
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received August 14—2:01 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>45. My 44, August 11th, 4 p.m.<anchor n="30" xml:id="d683-f1"/> Shaikh Yusuf
                    Yassin, Foreign Ministry representative, has returned to Jidda and this morning
                    the request was presented orally and jointly with British Minister.</p>
                <p>A reply is expected in about a week.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Cairo.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moose</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
